{"version":1,"key":"card:722","content":{"id":722,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a3d7a5c9-33a0-42e8-a080-be17d5415b68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当一个新兴大国崛起，必然会对现有霸权国家的地位构成挑战，双方之间是否注定走向冲突甚至战争？2012年，哈佛大学政治学者格雷厄姆·艾利森（Graham Allison）将这一结构性困境命名为「修昔底德陷阱」。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c1c83eaa-87e7-4180-8dce-dd25f58ed939","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"该术语源自古希腊历史学家修昔底德（Thucydides）。他在《伯罗奔尼撒战争史》中记录了雅典与斯巴达之间的毁灭性战争，并对战争根本原因做出了经典总结：「使得战争无可避免的原因是雅典日益壮大的力量，以及这种力量在斯巴达造成的恐惧。」艾利森由此提炼出一般性规律：崛起国与守成国之间存在结构性压力，极易引发冲突。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6471750-e1c3-46d3-b19f-8d352570bbcb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在当前国际关系中，修昔底德陷阱常被用来形容中美关系。随着中国不断崛起，两国的结构性矛盾在多个维度显现："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"73a4ce23-3508-4565-8372-519e351bb68a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"82608e43-6d8b-4c17-b640-799c40afd845","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6bb72ff5-8e3f-4de9-8c0e-4cdab6d01097","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经济科技：中美曾是互补关系，美国占据产业链顶端负责研发和标准制定，中国处于中低端提供制造和劳动力，双方各取所需。但中国出于跨越中等收入陷阱的需要，开始向高科技和产业链上游发展，不可避免地与美国产生竞争。高科技和金融霸权是美国维持全球主导地位的基石，一旦中国在芯片、AI等领域占据主导，美国的底层经济逻辑就会动摇，因此美国采取「小院高墙」策略进行技术封锁和出口管制"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"32e35820-fd72-478f-90d2-4e0bbaf97b59","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3fdcc74a-f213-44cb-b65e-58b4b9ed7c32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"国际秩序：二战后美国主导建立了联合国、IMF、世界银行、WTO 等体系，但中国在其中的话语权与经济体量严重不匹配。中国自然会去创建新的公共产品，如「一带一路」倡议、亚投行、金砖国家扩员等。崛起国要求「修改群规」或「另建新群」，守成国则视之为对现有秩序的颠覆"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0166d21-2316-4344-be6a-89fac01d0417","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不过，修昔底德陷阱也招致了不少反对和批评："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"64098909-8f15-425c-a05b-3281b6b6f6bc","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9a4be451-a4ae-4e4c-8aab-5d31e84205b4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe969617-777e-4079-ab8a-b14231b3bcce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自我实现的预言：如果两国领导层和民众都盲目相信冲突不可避免，从而将对方预设为敌人，反而会促使冲突真实发生，陷阱本身成了制造陷阱的原因"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"91d4e788-30bd-491c-a303-f89bbea0e938","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fa2a0d5f-5668-41c0-8e7a-36217a776862","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"核威慑：核武器的存在根本性地改变了大国博弈的成本计算，使得大国之间极少发生直接军事冲突"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cb0adc46-c0f9-4a83-a834-8d22b0a84291","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d43818f5-6874-4d61-a375-c37e3d029185","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"全球经济深度互依：全球经济已经形成你中有我、我中有你的复杂网络，经济上的相互依赖为战争爆发设置了巨大阻力"}]}]}]}],"tags":["国际政治/修昔底德陷阱","概念"],"createTime":1778995696189,"updateTime":1779005331397,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1779005331397}}